<title>SLOVAKIA: Details of Slovak first quarter 1997 GDP data.</title>
<headline>Details of Slovak first quarter 1997 GDP data.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are details of Slovak first quarter 1997 gross domestic product (GDP) as released by the Statistical Bureau (SUSR) on Wednesday.</p>
<p> GROSS DOMESTIC PRODUCT	    Q1 1997    FY 1996  Q1 1996</p>
<p>  real change yr/yr (pct)	    +5.1	 +6.9     +7.3</p>
<p>  absolute amount (SKK bln)	 148.0	443.3    133.5</p>
<p>(pct change)</p>
<p>  household demand		     +7.9	 +7.2     +7.4</p>
<p>  state administration demand	+3.6	+24.2    +32.4</p>
<p>  gross capital creation	    +19.0	+33.3    +25.9</p>
<p>  exports of goods/services	  +7.4	 -1.6     -6.6</p>
<p>  imports of goods/services	  +5.3	+18.5    +16.9</p>
<p>change in stocks and reserves</p>
<p>  (SKK bln)				+2.0	 +6.5     +5.4</p>
<p>Note. All figures are preliminary and subjects to revision.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-521-8402</p>
</text>
